---
import Figure from '../Figure.astro'
---

<Figure
  id="fig-allocation-steps"
  title="The allocation loop"
  summary="For each token in order, the validator holds a running remaining value and walks the outputs from the first unused slot. Unspendable outputs are skipped without consuming anything. If the current output value is less than or equal to the remaining value, the output is coloured for its full satoshi value and the remaining value drops. If it is larger, the loop stops and whatever remains is burned. If the whole plan could not be made cleanly, every token restarts from output zero."
>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 720 330" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs>
      <marker id="as-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="var(--d-line)" />
      </marker>
    </defs>
    <g font-family="var(--bu-font-sans)" font-size="12.5">
      <rect x="240" y="8" width="240" height="38" rx="8" fill="var(--d-accent-fill)" stroke="var(--d-accent)" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <text x="360" y="32" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="640" fill="var(--d-ink)">remaining = coloured input total</text>

      <line x1="360" y1="46" x2="360" y2="66" stroke="var(--d-line)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#as-arrow)" />

      <rect x="240" y="70" width="240" height="38" rx="8" fill="var(--d-fill)" stroke="var(--d-line)" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <text x="360" y="94" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--d-ink)">take the next output slot</text>

      <line x1="360" y1="108" x2="360" y2="128" stroke="var(--d-line)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#as-arrow)" />

      <path d="M360 132 L470 164 L360 196 L250 164 Z" fill="var(--d-fill)" stroke="var(--d-line)" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <text x="360" y="160" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--d-ink)">unspendable?</text>
      <text x="360" y="177" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--d-soft)" font-size="11.5">skip, consume nothing</text>
      <line x1="470" y1="164" x2="560" y2="164" stroke="var(--d-line)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#as-arrow)" />
      <text x="566" y="160" fill="var(--d-soft)">yes, next slot</text>

      <line x1="360" y1="196" x2="360" y2="214" stroke="var(--d-line)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#as-arrow)" />

      <path d="M360 218 L490 252 L360 286 L230 252 Z" fill="var(--d-accent-fill)" stroke="var(--d-accent)" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <text x="360" y="248" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="640" fill="var(--d-ink)">value &lt;= remaining?</text>
      <text x="360" y="266" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--d-soft)" font-size="11.5">whole output value only</text>

      <line x1="230" y1="252" x2="150" y2="252" stroke="var(--d-risk)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#as-arrow)" />
      <rect x="8" y="230" width="138" height="46" rx="8" fill="var(--d-risk-fill)" stroke="var(--d-risk)" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <text x="77" y="250" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="640" fill="var(--d-risk)">no</text>
      <text x="77" y="267" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--d-ink)" font-size="11.5">remaining burns</text>

      <line x1="490" y1="252" x2="570" y2="252" stroke="var(--d-ok)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#as-arrow)" />
      <rect x="576" y="230" width="136" height="46" rx="8" fill="var(--d-ok-fill)" stroke="var(--d-ok)" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <text x="644" y="250" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="640" fill="var(--d-ok)">yes</text>
      <text x="644" y="267" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--d-ink)" font-size="11.5">colour it fully</text>

      <path d="M644 230 L644 89 L484 89" fill="none" stroke="var(--d-line)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 4" marker-end="url(#as-arrow)" />
      <text x="500" y="82" fill="var(--d-soft)" font-size="11.5">loop while remaining &gt; 0</text>

      <text x="8" y="316" fill="var(--d-soft)">If any token could not be placed cleanly, the whole plan is discarded and every token restarts from output zero.</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
</Figure>
